  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRC African Leader Scheme Award to identify, quantify and address the underlying behavioural causes of persisting malaria transmission in climatically distinct geographic strata, so that they can be optimally tackled with supplementary vector control measures.</narrative>
